nova-sftp (1.6.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Flagship Release: Transformed application into a complete Remote Infrastructure Suite.
  * Added "Command Center" with Live Fleet Matrix, async resource polling, and desktop threshold alerts.
  * Added Visual Docker Manager to restart containers, tail logs, and manage Docker Compose stacks.
  * Added Multi-Tab Code Workspace with dynamic IDE themes (Dracula/Monokai), strict syntax highlighting, and Find/Replace.
  * Added Visual Cron Task Scheduler to edit, pause, and run crontab entries.
  * Added SSH Key Vault & Deployer (Visual ssh-copy-id) with local Ed25519 generation.
  * Added APT Updates & Let's Encrypt SSL Expiry Monitor.
  * Added Checksum Verifier (MD5/SHA256) to local and remote context menus.
  * Added Terminal upgrades: Up/Down command history and remote Tab-completion.
  * Added Disaster Recovery: 1-Click directory snapshots and Rclone backup runner.
  * Added Visual SSH Tunnels for secure 1-click port forwarding (MariaDB, Portainer, etc.).

